<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life &nbsp;(Read 2631 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=894" title="View the profile of Bryarious">Bryarious</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 3<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/brain-alien.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								To Play or NOT to Play - what a no brainer!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=894"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org" title="Dragon&#039;s Fist" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11886#msg11886"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11886#msg11886">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #45 on:</b> October 20, 2004, 06:53:30 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So many people, but I know that I cannot remember all of there names right now....<br /><br /><b>Danuvienne</b> and <b>Eumil</b> - Two great RL friends who introduced me to this game and with it helped me through some very low times in my life.&nbsp; Dany, I love ya babe!<br /><br /><b>Kainoa, Khaarma, Barstow, and all the clerics of Dragon&#039;s Fist </b>(past and present) - who put up with my constant questions and taught me to be the cleric I am today!<br /><br /><b>Wyztyz/Lyztyz and the rest of the DF family</b> - for giving me a place to feel at home in the crazy world of Norrath.&nbsp; I love you guys!&nbsp; DF - HELL YEAH!!<br /><br />And the person who has had the greatest impact on my EQ life (and my RL too):<br />&nbsp;<b>Edari</b> - She has been a wonderful friend from the day I met her in DSP.&nbsp; We helped each other through some tough times and bad relationships, until a relationship began to form between us.&nbsp; Eventually I knew I had to meet her and flew from MN to FL to visit for 2 weeks.&nbsp; Well to make a long story short, she packed what things she had into her car and instead of flying back, we drove from FL to MN.&nbsp; That was 16 months ago, and 4 months ago she allowed me the honor of taking her hand in marriage.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/aktion031.gif" alt="aktion031" border="0" /> I love you dear!&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm37.gif" alt="cwm37" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br /><b>These wonderful people are living proof that anyone who says nothing good can come from EverQuest are full of&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" /> !! </b><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><b>Bryarious Keepumlivin</b><br /><i>Cleric of the 66th Order of Bristlebane</i><br /><b><i>Dragons Fist</i></b><br /><br />~Sanity is a delusion of the truly insane~
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11888"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15" title="View the profile of Killy">Killy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Goddess of Whips and Rezzes<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 485<br />
