								<img src="http://home.comcast.net/~nlfalkowski/ss/clericanim02.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/KillyCirce" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="KillyCirce" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Lepredes"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Lepredes&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Lepredes" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.echoesineternity.org/" title="EIE" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11888#msg11888"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11888#msg11888">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #46 on:</b> October 20, 2004, 08:32:12 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							omg that is so sweet <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Killy
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11900"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765" title="View the profile of Moraganna">Moraganna</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 73<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ceres.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Kiss muh cute ass~<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11900#msg11900"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg11900#msg11900">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #47 on:</b> October 20, 2004, 03:49:49 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Serrenity/Qenam/Moraganna and Lenlanu -- For being really nice to me and letting me tag along with them back in the day just to heal and mooch xp.</div><br />Wow I am a slacker at reading these boards, I just found this killy. I still miss BoT days with Aliaara you and me. Back before it became Karnors part 2. <br /><br />In the past 4 years I have played EQ almost everyday and met a lot of different people. <br /><br />The first person who made an impact in my life was Lenlanu, one of my best friends.<br /><br />I also owe a great many thanks to Adreanna/Ascending and Ginsong for helping Vrabek and I get together irl. <br /><br />Kilaer, you and I where great friends, almost inseperable for over a year. I learned a vast amount from you and took that knowledge when I made Moraganna. Thank you for all you have done for me and showed me Kilaer.<br /><br />I also wanted to add that AxS was the best guild I was ever in, a truely great group of people who forever changed my look at guilds and people in EQ. &lt;3 and miss you all.<br /><br />I want to thank Vrabek the most for keeping me grounded. Even when I let this game get to me, he was always there to show me that it doesn&#039;t always matter, and not to let shit get to me.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=847985" target="_blank"> <img src="http://home.mindspring.com/~jkocie/bb.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a> <br /><br />BUFF BISH<br />Moraganna Macabre<br />&quot;I don&#039;t know the the key to success, but the key to failure is trying to please everbody&quot;</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12636"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=938" title="View the profile of Crushalot">Crushalot</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
