							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hmmm where do I start...<br /><br />Garlick - Because if it wasn&#039;t for her, I would have never started playing /hugs<br /><br />Ahnissa - For getting me away from Kaammaa and giving me a beautiful son.<br /><br />Geminia - For being my best EQ friend.<br /><br />Kinsonn and all the other freaky panty eaters - Just for picking me up whenever I was down.
