							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							small list lots of people i had fun with, but these are exceptional:<br /><br />Daarksun- can inspire people to walk through walls<br />Dyaan-one of the best clerics I ever grouped with<br />Loli-super puller<br />Keyes-showed me the ropes ages ago when I first started playing<br />Kimmy-nuff said<br />Bashem-one of the nicer people I have met<br />Gylen-best paladin on the server in my opinion<br />Corona-one of the most knowledgable people I knew<br />Fargus-another one of the coolest people anyone could know<br />Tavaran-one of my favorite people to hang out with<br />Reptak-first really good leezard I met<br />Zretch-very cool dude<br />Nepenthe-awesome player and person<br />Sanatarium,Meroci,Snakes,Vulu-other bards I would talk to all the time
