	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13516"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991" title="View the profile of Brandeewine">Brandeewine</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.brandeewine.com/IMGicon.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								HAHAHA!...I mean...That&#039;s terrible!...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:brandeewine16@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg13516#msg13516"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg13516#msg13516">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #50 on:</b> January 04, 2005, 04:46:33 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;m new to this board, and relatively new to Rodcet Nife (trasferred from The Nameless), but there are some people I&#039;ve met worth note:<br /><br /><b>Stags</b> - Always willing to help on a quest, regardless of how dumb the reward<br /><b>Kastore</b> - Doesn&#039;t matter what&#039;s happening, if someone&#039;s in need, he&#039;s there<br /><b>Transhade</b> - For pushing me to achieve what I&#039;d been putting off for so long<br /><b>Sirenna</b> - Best friend from The Nameless who followed me over to Rodcet Nife, just to keep our friendship close<br /><b>Notguna</b> - Always willing to help, always fun to be with<br /><b>Mukakuah</b> - Again, someone always willing to help friends level, even if it means he gets left behind his other friends<br /><b>Whyz</b> - Regardless of how crappy her day went, she&#039;s there to listen to your vent over trivial matters<br /><b>Talnifin</b> - Close to being generous to a fault<br /><b>Xaanru</b> - Always willing to help others progress and improve, and always there to be the mature one when things get out of hand<br /><b>Winterswan</b> - Truely one of the sweetest people I know<br /><b>Santics</b> - Well, being married to Winterswan, it&#039;s a given he has to be a pretty awesome guy<br /><b>Mirgond</b> - For bittersweet memories (Nameless Server)<br /><b>Doonthi / Viranel</b> - for helping me when I was first returning to EQ in 2001 (Nameless Server)<br /><b>Valecia</b> - For being the sweetest Necromancer zonewide<br /><br />The list could go on and on....
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
