							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eumil is my CHEESE!&nbsp; Him and I go Waaayyy back to hunting icy orcs with his warrior LOL and Danny Wuv ya :D ....Qumdyien he&#039;s my always in bazaar mode enchanter LOL... Holy moley there are so many I have over 100 of you folks in my friends list LOL so I am trying to remember you all...Luedera for buffing me and Crafty for spaking me :D....NARTUUK&nbsp; my pink ogre in shining armor.....you can bite me anytime.&nbsp; Yanwolf and all her alts.&nbsp; (she has way to many can never be sure which one she is going to bring up) ...Tenyo she has been a friend though some tough times.&nbsp; Alisterex who I migh add plays not enough and I don&#039;t see very often anymore.&nbsp; Can ya tell I have alot of friends??!!&nbsp; LOL so I will see you all in game You know it is a treat to have you all as close friends.....&nbsp; But most of all my ultime greatest person I love with all my heart is Daydreamer/Zipster/Slugga my RL husband he is the guy that got me playing....errr ummm addicted to this game thanks babe I love playing with you :D<br /><br /><br />Love Eshebala
